// Use the shared block +oracle without defining it in the diagram
architecture Bring a price on chain

box source as Price source [note: data off chain, icon: globe]
+oracle feed as Oracle [note: reports the price]
box pool as Lending pool [note: reads the price, icon: chain]

step Fetch
  say The oracle fetches the latest price from the source off chain.
  source -> feed: price

step Report
  say The oracle writes the price on chain, and the lending pool reads it.
  feed -> pool: price update
